The '''YV-865 ''Aurore''-class freighter''' was a highly durable model of [[freighter]] built by the [[Corellian Engineering Corporation]]. Due to their excessive use by the [[Zygerrian Slave Empire]], they were often nicknamed '''Zygerrian slave ships'''.

==Characteristics==
[[File:MiningGuildSentry-SWZ.png|thumb|left|270px|A Mining Guild ''Aurore''-class freighter is escorted by a pair of TIE/mg sentries.]]
YV-865 ''Aurore''-class [[freighter]]s<ref name="SWE Zygerrian slave ship" /> were large and blocky [[Starship|spacecraft]] with spacious cargo holds, large enough to hold a [[blixus]] or, in the case of the [[Zygerrian]]s, numerous [[Slavery|slaves]]. The powerful twin thruster [[engine]]s, albeit considered primitive by the [[time]] of the [[Clone Wars]], sat on two articulated boom arms that extended from each side of the ship's primary hull. These boom arms would fold up while the craft was landing, using the engines as supports. Despite its size and large cargo complement, the vessel could be competently operated by a single [[pilot]].<ref name="Kidnapped">{{TCW|Kidnapped}}</ref> For emergency situations, the freighter had one [[escape pod]] in the upper rear section which could be ejected from the craft.<ref name="Revival" />

==History==
During the [[Clone Wars]], it was used as a slave [[transport]] by the [[Zygerrian Slave Empire]] (giving it its nickname), who outfitted the storage bays for live cargo. [[Darts D'Nar]], a [[Zygerrian]] [[enslaver]], [[captain]]ed a reddish-[[color]]ed Zygerrian slave ship named the ''[[Tecora]]''.<ref name="Slaves of the Republic">{{TCW|Slaves of the Republic}}</ref> [[Delta-T-3]] was another ship used as a slave transport, transporting the captives [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]], [[Rex]], and [[Gupat Roshti]] to the [[Kadavo slave processing facility|facility]] on [[Kadavo]].<ref name="Escape from Kadavo">{{TCW|Escape from Kadavo}}</ref>

[[File:YV865AuroreClassFreighter-SaS.png|thumb|left|220px|An ''Aurore''-class freighter firing on Imperial stormtroopers]]
Its use was not limited to the Zygerrian Slave Empire, being used as a general-purpose [[freighter]] across [[the galaxy]]. One was owned by the [[InterGalactic Banking Clan]] at the [[Cybloc Transfer Station]],<ref name="Revival" /> as well as by [[Preigo]] and his [[Preigo's Traveling World of Wonder|traveling circus]].<ref name="Bound for Rescue">{{TCW|Bound for Rescue}}</ref>

In [[3 BBY]], the [[Partisans]] operated an Aurore-class.<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?" />

The [[Mining Guild]] used such vessels as well. Two years before the [[Battle of Yavin]], an ''Aurore''-class freighter was patrolling the [[Sereeda Waypoint]] with two [[TIE/mg Mining Guild starfighter]]s when the ships encountered the rebel attack shuttle ''[[Phantom]]''.<ref name="Steps Into Shadow" />

In [[35 ABY]],<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of {{Film|IX}} to [[35 ABY]].</ref> at least one ''Aurore''-class freighter was part of the [[Citizens' Fleet]] at the [[Battle of Exegol]] between the [[Resistance]] and the [[Sith Eternal]].<ref name="Episode IX">{{Film|IX}}</ref>

